{"id":"vod_bf_43536","vodId":"43536","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"游戏人生","name_cn":"游戏人生","date":"2014-01-01","year":"2014","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://img.bfzypic.com/upload/vod/20230424-44/5337894d59c061534351d916ed780bd5.jpg"},"summary":"空（松冈祯丞 配音）和白（茅野爱衣）是网络世界里人尽皆知的传奇人物，两人在虚拟的战斗中所向披靡，甚至被称为传说一般的存在。然而，在现实世界中，兄妹两人却是连家门都不敢出的“御宅族”，患有严重的人群恐惧症。　　某日，空和白收到了一位陌生少年传来的讯息，因而被召唤到了异世界中 ，在这里，人类种、森精种、天翼种和机凯种生活在同一片土地之上，这里没有战争和暴力，有的只是一场又一场无休无止的游戏，一切利益和权利，皆由游戏的结果决定。弱势的人类种在游戏中节节败退最终蜗居在最后一片净土之上，空和白的到来能否改变这悲惨的现状？","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-04-29 23:10:06","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/youxirensheng/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/youxirensheng/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/youxirensheng/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/youxirensheng/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/youxirensheng/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/youxirensheng/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/youxirensheng/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/youxirensheng/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/youxirensheng/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/youxirensheng/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/youxirensheng/第11集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/youxirensheng/第12集/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T09:15:29.266Z"}